Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Pākoro hou: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault whakamuna: message kī: key.
>> decrypted := vault wetemuna: encrypted kī: key.

Huaputa 
tuhi: ['Message:'], rārangi-hou
tuhi: message, rārangi-hou
tuhi: ['Decrypted:'], rārangi-hou
tuhi: decrypted, rārangi-hou.
